    "description": {
      "value": "<p>A creature of your choice within range gains a level 4 spell slot, which it can use to cast any spell it has prepared. The slot vanishes once it is expended or when the creature finishes a Long Rest.</p><p>In addition, you regain one expended use of Wild Shape.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-WljexXfdgcB6Ud09\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>The effect adds the level 4 slot to the maximum: also add it to the creature’s current slots, and delete the effect once the slot is spent or after a Long Rest. Restore your use of Wild Shape by hand.</p></section>",
